{"slug":"q-d-m","ar":"ق د م","total":48,"core":"going before; sending forth; foot","forms":[{"ar":"قَدَّمَ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":27,"gloss":"to send forth; to put forward","word":null,"ex":{"s":89,"a":24,"p":3,"ar":["يَقُولُ","يَـٰلَيْتَنِى","قَدَّمْتُ","لِحَيَاتِى"],"en":"He will say, \"Oh, I wish I had sent ahead [some good] for my life"}},{"ar":"قَدَم","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":8,"gloss":"foot; footing","word":null,"ex":{"s":55,"a":41,"p":6,"ar":["يُعْرَفُ","ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ","بِسِيمَـٰهُمْ","فَيُؤْخَذُ","بِٱلنَّوَٰصِى","وَٱلْأَقْدَامِ"],"en":"The criminals will be known by their marks, and they will be seized by the forelocks and the feet"}},{"ar":"يَسْتَقْدِمُ","kind":"verb","form":10,"count":4,"gloss":"to seek to advance; to go ahead","word":null,"ex":{"s":34,"a":30,"p":10,"ar":["قُل","لَّكُم","مِّيعَادُ","يَوْمٍ","لَّا","تَسْتَـْٔخِرُونَ","عَنْهُ","سَاعَةً","وَلَا","تَسْتَقْدِمُونَ"],"en":"Say, \"For you is the appointment of a Day [when] you will not remain thereafter an hour, nor will you precede [it]"}},{"ar":"قَدِيم","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"old, ancient","word":null,"ex":{"s":12,"a":95,"p":6,"ar":["قَالُوا۟","تَٱللَّهِ","إِنَّكَ","لَفِى","ضَلَـٰلِكَ","ٱلْقَدِيمِ"],"en":"They said, \"By Allah, indeed you are in your [same] old error"}},{"ar":"قَدِمْ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":2,"gloss":"to precede, lead","word":null,"ex":{"s":11,"a":98,"p":1,"ar":["يَقْدُمُ","قَوْمَهُۥ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","فَأَوْرَدَهُمُ","ٱلنَّارَ ۖ","وَبِئْسَ","ٱلْوِرْدُ","ٱلْمَوْرُودُ"],"en":"He will precede his people on the Day of Resurrection and lead them into the Fire; and wretched is the place to which they are led"}},{"ar":"تَقَدَّمَ","kind":"verb","form":5,"count":2,"gloss":"to go forward, advance","word":null,"ex":{"s":74,"a":37,"p":5,"ar":["لِمَن","شَآءَ","مِنكُمْ","أَن","يَتَقَدَّمَ","أَوْ","يَتَأَخَّرَ"],"en":"To whoever wills among you to proceed or stay behind"}},{"ar":"أَقْدَمُون","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"g